# Murmur — git ignore

# ===== Sensitive: never commit user data =====
**/decrypted/
**/agent_reports/
**/voice_transcripts/
**/Documents/Murmur/
**/.murmur/
**/config.json
**/shared_preferences.json
**/EchoTrace/
